        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Baldwin Estates Collection 5161 Lever With 5046 Rosette</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Baldwin 5161 Contemporary Lever features a 2 piece lever and stem design making it the popular choice of interior design professionals. Easy to install, this long lasting solid brass door lever is backed by a lifetime mechanical warranty. It will fit 1-3/8\" and 1-3/4\" door thicknesses with an optional backset for 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\".</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Baldwin 5161-5046 Leverset:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Accessibility Code (ADA) A117.1</li>\r\n<li>Fits 2-1/8\" pre-drilled bore holes.</li>\r\n<li>Concealed mounting to hide unsightly installation screws.</li>\r\n<li>Forged from solid brass for maximum strength and durability.</li>\r\n<li>28 degree latch rotation</li>\r\n<li>Heavy duty latch bolt springs.</li>\r\n<li>Latches are reversible for right or left hand doors.</li>\r\n<li>Latches include standard full lip strike.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Baldwin 5161 Lever:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>5046 Rose Diameter: 2-5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>5161 Lever Length: 4-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Overall Projection: 2.65\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset: choose either 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: adjustable for 1-3/8\" and 1-3/4\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting a Function:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Half Dummy:</b> A surfaced mounted, non-working, smooth lever. Non-locking and non-latching trim for one side of door. This inactive pull is usually used to match trim. </li>\r\n<li><b>Full Dummy:</b> A surfaced mounted, non-working, smooth lever. Non-locking and non-latching trim for both sides of door. These inactive pulls are usually used to match trim.</li>\r\n<li><b>Passage (hall or closet):</b> Latches but does not lock. The latch is activated by turning the either of the two levers.</li>\r\n<li><b>Privacy (bedroom or bathroom):</b> Latches and can be locked. Can be locked from the inside with a push-button located on the rosette. An emergency release function allows the lever to automatically unlock when it is turned from the inside.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe <b>Half Dummy function is handed.</b> <a href=\"/pages/how-to-order-door-hardware\"><b>Click Here to Determine Handing</b></a>. All other lever functions are non-handed.\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Baldwin Brass Contemporary Leverset, Baldwin 5161-5046",
                "description": "The Baldwin 5161 Contemporary Lever features a 2 piece lever and stem design making it the popular choice of interior design professionals. Available in either Oil Rubbed Bronze, Satin Nickel, Satin Black or Polished Chrome finishes. Easy to install, this long lasting solid brass door lever is backed by a lifetime mechanical warranty. It will fit 1-3/8 inch and 1-3/4 inch door thicknesses with an optional backset for 2-3/8 inches or 2-3/4 inches.",
                "keywords": "BAL-5161-5046, Baldwin modern leversets, baldwin 5161 levers, baldwin 5046 roses, baldwin 5146 roses, solid brass leversets, contemporary levers, contemporary levesets, baldwin 5161 leversets, baldwin 5046 rosettes, baldwin estates collections, ada compliant levers, Baldwin Brass 5161 levers,"
